38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: The electrician quoted 34,000 yen per room for meters, plus annual checks. That is a significant upfront cost for us.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: The payment log shows three months were paid late, always after someone questioned the amount. It really has made the air tense here.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
