41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Benjamin, I found out the reconciliation template is a nightmare. Keying in every invoice and calculating five separate refunds takes forever.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: @Mio, that sounds exhausting. I found the plug-in monitors show one room uses four times more than the others, mostly from a heater.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @Jonathan, that confirms the usage is wildly uneven. @Benjamin, what did you find about the heating needs?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: @Mio, that sounds really hard. I hope we don’t have to do that. I just want us to stop fighting about the money.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: @Victoria, the sunlight data shows two rooms need heat from November, while the south pair stay warm. That explains the usage gap.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Benjamin, so the rooms are just naturally different? That makes the flat split feel really unfair to the cold rooms.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, yes, the rooms are unequal. But the monitor shows the gap is mostly one heater left running, not just the sunlight.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Jonathan, that distinction matters. If it’s habit, not the room, we might fix it without expensive meters.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I agree. If it’s just habits, maybe we can talk about that gently instead of blaming people.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, exactly. The room is fixed, but the habit is changeable. I’d rather we address the heater than the architecture.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Benjamin, I agree. But if we don’t meter, who checks the heater? I don’t want to be the one nagging everyone.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, the monitor readings already show the pattern. We don’t need a police force, just awareness.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, I understand the worry. But the upfront cost for meters is too high for me right now. I need a simpler solution.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Mio, I agree. If we just agree to be careful, maybe the tension goes away without anyone having to chase anyone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
